check 1
# UI draw list (PC 1 2026-10-10, local-pc1-today): Rogue Encampment arrival, then the belt rows shown (key 0xC0);
# the draw list of server tick 73 on both sides (as draws-town-arrival-ama).
# ScnAma, -seed 1234. The cursor is pinned at (790, 10) first: 1.14d reads the real pointer, and an unpinned one hovers whatever it was left on. Under the debugger 1.14d does not draw every tick: the run
# compares its last drawn tick <= 73 on both sides.
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md §3 rule 7; specs/ui/control-panel.md, specs/ui/inventory.md.
name ui-draws-belt-ama
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 76
seconds 600
channels draws
draws-at 73
input frame 38; move 790 10; frame 40; key 0xC0
